### How to actually retrieve this data

If you have access to the VirusTotal API, you can perform a GET request similar to the following (replace `<ELITE_API_KEY>` with your actual key):

```
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/ip_addresses/123.123.123.123?limit=7&cursor=next_seven
Authorization: Bearer <ELITE_API_KEY>
Accept: application/json
```

This will return a JSON payload containing the WHOIS data descriptors for the requested IP address, limited to 7 results, and include a continuation cursor named `next_seven`.

